s required. The source averages discharges in its advection correction, but the printed last y-average combines (i,j+1/2) with (i+1,j-1/2), so the full reported identity is not certified. The references to (B.54) are retained as written, not repaired to an assumed momentum equation number."], "gaps_left": ["This is the document algebraic change of primitive variable from HU to U, derived using continuity; no independent code absence proof is required. The source averages discharges in its advection correction, but the printed last y-average combines (i,j+1/2) with (i+1,j-1/2), so the full reported identity is not certified. The references to (B.54) are retained as written, not repaired to an assumed momentum equation number."]}], "document_differences": [], "symbols": [{"symbol": "H", "definition_locator": {"path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "paragraph_start_xml_ordinal": 100959}, "definition_quote": "In which U is the depth averaged velocity vector in x, V in y, H the water depth. A simple semi-discretization of  using central differences for the space derivative and using the Hansen scheme for the coupling between velocity and free surface results in:", "meaning": "water depth"}, {"symbol": "H̄", "definition_locator": {"path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "paragraph_start_xml_ordinal": 103023}, "definition_quote": "H̄^{n+1}_{i+1/2,j}=1/2(H^{n+1}_{i+1,j}+H^{n+1}_{i,j}); ^x q̄^{n+1/2}_{i,j}=1/2(^x q^{n+1/2}_{i+1/2,j}+^x q^{n+1/2}_{i-1/2,j}); ^y q̄^{n+1/2}_{i+1/2,j+1/2}=1/2(^y q^{n+1/2}_{i,j+1/2}+^y q^{n+1/2}_{i+1,j-1/2}).", "meaning": "arithmetic mean explicitly defined by (B.57); preserve printed y stencil", "context_basis": {"method": "opened render image", "path": "_staging/total-read/model-audit/XBeach/connectivity/manuals-docx-read/full-visual-read/kingsday/page-142.png", "sha256": "1fae8aae72c0e693d57