in )    then\n                  !\n                  delta1    = (s%uu(i,j) -uu_old(iw ,j)) / s%dsz(i,j)\n                  delta2    = (s%uu(iw,j)-uu_old(iww,j)) / s%dsz(iw,j)\n                  wrk1(i,j) = 0.5d0*s%dsu(iw,j) * minmod(delta1,delta2) * qx", "sha256": "33d588f751f2faffb02b0c97854a0a975f67ab7851492d7927c8ff68d545b3de"}, {"role": "document_text", "path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx", "line_start": 1, "line_end": 1, "quote": "In which U is the depth averaged velocity vector in x, V in y, H the water depth. A simple semi-discretization of  using central differences for the space derivative and using the Hansen scheme for the coupling between velocity and free surface results in:", "sha256": "c78396a23cec17b13be94ab1deef921c89b3d0c6a3d1f7d05e7d741e432c6543", "locator": {"path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "paragraph_start_xml_ordinal": 100959}, "quote_method": "Source DOCX defining paragraph w:t; inline q definitions separately transcribed from an opened image."}, {"role": "document_text", "path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx", "line_start": 1, "line_end": 1, "quote": "In which U is the depth averaged velocity vector in x, V in y, H the water depth. A simple semi-discretization of  using central differences for the space derivative and using the Hansen scheme for the coupling between velocity and free surface results in:", "sha256": "c78396a23cec17b13be94ab1deef921c89b3d0c6a3d1f7d05e7d741e432c6543", "locator": {"path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "paragraph_start_xml_ordinal": 100959}, "quote_method": "Source DOCX defining paragraph w:t; inline q definitions separately transcribed from an opened image."}, {"role": "document_text", "path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_king